  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Agriculture Working Group (AWG) Kenya and the Netherlands</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Kenya and the Netherlands have a long-standing relationship in agricultural cooperation and trade. In 2019, this resulted in the establishment of the Kenya - Netherlands Agricultural Working Group (AWG). Due to Covid-19, the physical AWG did not take place in the period between 2020-2022. The Agricultural Working Group (AWG) meeting in the Netherlands will take place from 17- 21st April 2023.The purpose of this AWG meeting is to foster bilateral cooperation between the Netherlands and Kenya in the area of sustainable agriculture. This program will focus on bilateral cooperation in phytosanitary, veterinary and electronic certification.</narrative>
  </description>
